						]
						// Col2
						[
							`Clause 4.3 of the MX Procedures shows the dedicated email address field.`
							pnz::br
							pnz::italic_div( "(SCP Customer notifications)" )
							[
								pnz::bold("XML Path")
								pnz::text("for Email Address:")
							]
							pnz::br
							`/ Document / FIToFICstmrCdtTrf / CdtTrfTxInf / Cdtr / CtctDtls / EmailAdr`
						]
					]

					// Row 1
					[
						// Col 1
						[
							`Has been sent an HVCS instruction:`
							pnz::bullets(
								[
									pnz::text( "As a customer credit transfer message — " )
